text @[Male Student]
text Hm? Who are you?
label 29
text The boy looks up.
text He has the face of someone who looks as though he came out of the womb already in the student council.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm here in place of Nagisa Furukawa, the girl who was just here.
sound H4J.aac
text @[Male Student]
text In her place?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah. I'll talk on her behalf.
sound H4K.aac
text @[Male Student]
text What's your name?
text @[Tomoya]
text Okazaki.
sound H4L.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Please wait.
text He picks up one of the fliers from the table and looks it over from corner to corner.
sound H4M.aac
text @[Male Student]
text The only name listed on this is "President: Nagisa Furukawa."
text @[Tomoya]
text That's right.
sound H4N.aac
text @[Male Student]
text In other words, Nagisa Furukawa is the student responsible for this matter.
text @[Tomoya]
text That's right.
sound H4O.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Please leave.
text He looks back at his word processor's screen.
text @[Tomoya]
text Hey, hold on.
text @[Tomoya]
text I came all the way here for this, and that's how you're gonna treat me, punk?
sound H4P.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Regardless of how much work it took you to get here, I don't recall ever asking for you.
text @[Tomoya]
text Like I said, I'm here in place of Nagisa Furukawa.
sound H4Q.aac
text @[Male Student]
text We do not recognize alternates.
text @[Tomoya]
text Why not?
sound H4R.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Because it will complicate any discussions.
sound H4S.aac
text @[Male Student]
text That is how discussions work. The more people that get in the middle, the more complicated they get and the more time you waste.
text He continues to respond to me in a calm manner, even after I start to act threatening.
text Dealing with guys like this takes a lot of work...
text @[Tomoya]
text Fine, then I'll bring her with me. Will that make you happy?
sound H4T.aac
text @[Male Student]
text You don't have the right to be present in these discussions.
text @[Tomoya]
text Why not?!
sound H4U.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Ugh... fine, whatever. Go get her if you must.
sound H4V.aac
text @[Male Student]
text But I will not allow you to make any comments.
text @[Tomoya]
text What's the difference, then?
sound H4W.aac
text @[Male Student]
text We have a rule that we will only speak to individuals responsible for any given situation.
sound H4X.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Club presidents should gather any opinions that their members have ahead of time and present those to us in a summarized fashion.
text @[Tomoya]
text She's not good at talking.
sound H4Y.aac
text @[Male Student]
text That is none of my concern.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text I get the feeling that I won't be able to out-argue him.
text @[Tomoya]
text Tch...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...I never knew.
sound H4Z.aac
text @[Male Student]
text You never knew what?
text @[Tomoya]
text That this school's student council was being run by a cold-hearted jerk like you.
sound H50.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Indeed.
text He admits it.
sound H51.aac
text @[Male Student]
text It's unfortunate, but I can't help it if some portion of the student body thinks of us in that way.
